      "releaseNotes": "HRV4Training: a complete app redesign, with improved usability and new features. This update also fixes getting HRV4Training Pro from the app, account registration, reading data from Apple Health and Oura, and a few crashes. We have now also added more export options. More on our Substack: https://marcoaltini.substack.com\n\nIf you find the app useful, please take a few minutes to review it. It makes a difference. Thank you!\n\nFor any issues, write to hello@HRV4Training.com and we'll do our best to help.\n\nCheers, Marco & Ale",
